    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορά</span></b>  (A), ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skin when taken off, hide,</i> of beasts, 
